<% layout('/layouts/boilerplate') -%>

<main class="static-page">
  <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
  <p class="updated">Last updated: 24 October 2026</p>
  <p>By using Homekuti you agree to these terms.</p>

  <h2>Your account</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Give accurate details and verify your email before booking or hosting.</li>
    <li>Keep your password safe. You're responsible for activity on your account.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Booking &amp; payment</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The total you see at checkout is what you pay: nightly price (covers 2 guests), any extra-guest charge, GST (5% up to ₹7,500/night, 18% above) and a ₹20 service fee.</li>
    <li>When you click Pay, your dates are held for 10 minutes. A booking is confirmed only after payment succeeds.</li>
    <li>If your payment completes after the dates were taken by someone else, you get a full automatic refund.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Cancellations &amp; refunds</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>7 days or more before check-in: <strong>100%</strong> refund.</li>
    <li>Between 24 hours and 7 days: <strong>50%</strong> refund.</li>
    <li>Less than 24 hours, or after check-in: <strong>no refund</strong>.</li>
    <li>GST is not refunded when you cancel. If the host cancels, you get everything back, including GST.</li>
    <li>Refunds reach your original payment method in 5–7 business days.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Hosts</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Listings must be accurate and follow local laws.</li>
    <li>The Verified badge means our team has checked the listing. Changing its title, location or photo means it is checked again.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Reviews</h2>
  <p>Only guests who completed a stay can review it, once per stay. Reviews must be honest and respectful.</p>

  <h2>Our role</h2>
  <p>Homekuti connects guests and hosts. We may remove listings, reviews or accounts that break these terms.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:homekuti247@gmail.com">homekuti247@gmail.com</a></p>
</main>
